  English (default) UI text. Translations go in values-<language>/strings.xml
  (e.g. values-zh-rCN, values-de) with the same names; missing names fall back here.
  Guidelines that keep layouts working in every language:
  * Arguments are positional (%1$s, %2$d) so translations can reorder them.
  * Product names (Minecraft, Fabric, Modrinth, …) stay as they are.
  * Use ’ for apostrophes.
-->
